<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<addon id="service.subtitles.thunder"
       name="Thunder"
       version="0.2.1"
       provider-name="lijin">
    <requires>
        <import addon="xbmc.python" version="3.0.0"/>
        <import addon="script.module.chardet" version="3.0.4"/>
		<import addon="script.module.requests"/>
    </requires>
    <extension point="xbmc.subtitle.module"
               library="service.py" />
    <extension point="xbmc.addon.metadata">
        <summary lang="en">Thunder</summary>
        <summary lang="zh">迅雷字幕</summary>
        <summary lang="zh_TW">迅雷字幕</summary>
        <description lang="en">Thunder subtitle service</description>
        <description lang="zh">迅雷字幕插件</description>
        <description lang="zh_TW">迅雷字幕挿件</description>
        <platform>all</platform>
        <license>GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE. Version 2, June 1991</license>
        <assets>
            <icon>icon.png</icon>
            <clearlogo>logo.png</clearlogo>
            <fanart>resources/media/fanart.jpg</fanart>
            <screenshot>resources/media/screenshot_1.jpg</screenshot>
            <screenshot>resources/media/screenshot_2.jpg</screenshot>
            <screenshot>resources/media/screenshot_3.jpg</screenshot>
        </assets>
        <news>
V0.2.1 (2026-10-31)
- 修复字幕列表名称乱码：恢复旧中文编码和转义名称，清理已损坏的名称片段

V0.2.0 (2026-10-31)
- 修复 Kodi 20+ 路径接口、字幕下载和参数解析
- 增加请求超时、错误提示、ZIP 字幕选择和下载大小限制
- 修复 UTF-8 编码及简繁转换流程

V0.1.0 (2021-03-20)
- 在shooter源码的基础上进行修改，迅雷相关源码来自https://github.com/weaming/thunder-subtitle
        </news>
    </extension>
</addon>

